    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/2c10ce923cc3fbae3c74d1b2f55bed33.poster.avif?t=1755709314\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/2c10ce923cc3fbae3c74d1b2f55bed33.webm?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/2c10ce923cc3fbae3c74d1b2f55bed33.mp4?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You have damaged your ship and ended up on a planet where the air is unsuitable for breathing. But all is not lost! You will have to use all your skills and intelligence to survive and return to Earth.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/a960249acb43ddfc67d325c4038382ee.avif?t=1755709314\" data-has-big width=800 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/621e8c9c5df8d55a44e476db39c99683.poster.avif?t=1755709314\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/621e8c9c5df8d55a44e476db39c99683.webm?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/621e8c9c5df8d55a44e476db39c99683.mp4?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start with the basics \u2014 create a base that will be your refuge on this hostile planet. Develop a strategy to protect and develop your base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/f2189d6fb119d407ccfa98751fbfe827.avif?t=1755709314\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/a7d0b97dc8efde757d59e35217b27eb3.poster.avif?t=1755709314\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/a7d0b97dc8efde757d59e35217b27eb3.webm?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/a7d0b97dc8efde757d59e35217b27eb3.mp4?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Resources are your everything on this planet. Get them, manage them wisely and use them to terraform the planet and grow food.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/4477aab48568353e9e684b5a1edab576.avif?t=1755709314\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/f4141d4d6f716a1f30f4322c912a7874.poster.avif?t=1755709314\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/f4141d4d6f716a1f30f4322c912a7874.webm?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/f4141d4d6f716a1f30f4322c912a7874.mp4?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Turn a disastrous landscape into a picturesque paradise! Explore the environment, interact with the ecosystem of the planet and try to transform it into a green and picturesque area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/385ba6bafb255aa72d81e96ac9f9ed68.avif?t=1755709314\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/e7bb8c4160de9b8af9762b241007480b.poster.avif?t=1755709314\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/e7bb8c4160de9b8af9762b241007480b.webm?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/e7bb8c4160de9b8af9762b241007480b.mp4?t=1755709314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Besides the fact that you have to fight a hostile environment, there are dangers and secrets hiding on the planet. Solve the puzzles and face the threats to survive.<br><br><br>Build your base from scratch, discover new technologies, grow food and create unique ecosystems. Can you turn this inhospitable planet into a thriving place to live?<br>",
